        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9d55860b-fe98-466f-bff4-cc03fc75ece2).Image",
        "Description": "47,  I hope you&apos;ve brought plenty of emetic toys with you today because you are gonna need them! Our client is the toilet company that supply the toilets in the burj al ghazali. These four targets have all refused to have these toilets implemented into their houses. Therefore, the client thinks it would be appropriate that the last thing the bastards see is the company logo at the bottom of the toilet bowl! Good luck 47, and make sure to wash your hands when you&apos;ve finished with this one!",
